+++ b/news/+validate-jcal-name-tokens.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+jCal property names, parameter names and ``RRULE`` part names are now validated as iCalendar tokens when parsing jCal. They were kept verbatim and re-emitted into the content line on serialisation, so a name containing ``:``/``;`` or a lone carriage return could inject parameters or a new content line for consumers that treat a bare ``\r`` as a break. @alhudz
